+# Fourth pass: Västernäs, Klinten, southern Mariehamn, Ytternäs and the north — 2026-11-12
+
+Newly dated: 10,696.10 m in 63 persistent street objects (EPSG:3874), all new. No existing road was confirmed or changed, so nothing overlaps the earlier passes. Two objects are lanes: Västra Utfarten's west carriageway runs beside the already dated east carriageway and counts 0 m. Klintvägen's 1978 connection is two lanes around a refuge plus five short crossing pieces, and it counts once, as its longest lane (36.63 m).
+
